            </h1>

            <p class="lead-text" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 500; color: #1e293b;">
              Premium steel gate designs crafted for security, style, and durability. When selecting an entrance gate
              for your residence or commercial property, stainless steel (especially grade SS304) represents the
              pinnacle of modern architectural design, corrosion resistance, and effortless maintenance.
            </p>

            <div style="margin: 32px 0;">
              <img src="../images/about-3.jpg" alt="Steel Gate Design Showcase"
                style="width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius-md);"
