            </div>

            <h2>Types of Steel Gate Designs</h2>
            <p>
              Steel gates have evolved far beyond basic metal bars. At Harichand Steel, our fabrication workshop
              produces multiple distinctive gate design styles tailored to varying architectural languages:
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li><strong>Modern Steel Gate:</strong> Minimalist horizontal slat gates, integrated flush sheets, and
                contrasting metallic handles that match contemporary villa architecture.</li>
              <li><strong>Laser Cut CNC Steel Gates:</strong> Intricate geometric, floral, or abstract patterns cut into
                heavy gauge steel plates with computerized precision.</li>
              <li><strong>Aluminium Profile Steel Framework:</strong> Combining the structural rigidity of steel with
                the lightweight elegance and rust immunity of aluminium profiles.</li>
              <li><strong>Double Door Swing Gates:</strong> Classic majestic entrances ideal for wide driveways and
                bungalow entrances.</li>
              <li><strong>Sliding Motorized Steel Gates:</strong> Space-saving sliding track designs compatible with
                automatic remote sensors and mobile app controls.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="highlight-points" style="margin: 36px 0;">
              <div class="point-item">
                <i class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                <div>
                  <h5>SS304 Marine Grade</h5>
                  <p>Guaranteed rust-proof performance even under continuous monsoon rain and high humidity.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="point-item">
                <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>
                <div>
                  <h5>Motorization Ready</h5>
                  <p>Engineered balanced weight distribution for smooth operation with Italian and Indian gate motors.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2>Best Steel Gate Designs</h2>
            <p>
              Choosing the right design depends on property privacy requirements, air circulation, and structural
              proportions. Gates with full solid back-panels provide maximum visual security, while louvre and
              perforated slat patterns maintain air flow without compromising protection.
            </p>

            <blockquote>
              "A custom stainless steel entrance gate is not just a security barrier; it is the first visual impression
              of your property that retains its pristine shine for decades."
            </blockquote>

            <h2>Window Grill Design &amp; Architectural Railings</h2>
            <p>
              To maintain design coherence across your entire building facade, Harichand Steel fabricates matching
              window security grills, boundary wall panels, and balcony safety railings that harmonize with your main
              entrance gate design.
            </p>

            <h2>Looking for the Best Steel Gate Manufacturer?</h2>
            <p>
              With over 20 years of proven manufacturing excellence, Harichand Steel provides turnkey metal fabrication
              services across Delhi, Noida, Gurgaon, Faridabad, and Sonipat. From initial CAD drawing approvals to final
